scenario steady_saver_d3 is:
    the effective date of d3 is 2024-02-01.
    the gross amount of d3 is 0.
    the account value of the policy before d3 is 118836.850000000005821.
    net_deposit expects answers ["the net deposit of d3 is 0"].
    new_account_value expects answers ["the new account value of d3 is 118836.85"].
    checks expects answers ["d3 fails the check D001"].
    policy_after_account_value expects answers [].

query net_deposit is:
    the net deposit of which activity is which amount.

query new_account_value is:
    the new account value of which activity is which amount.

query checks is:
    which activity fails the check which code.

query policy_after_account_value is:
    the account value of the policy after which activity is which value.

the view deposit is:
    the title is "Deposit (annuity)".
    the case is a scenario.
    the facts about "the activity" are
        the effective date of an activity is a date,
        the gross amount of an activity is an amount.
    the facts about "the policy it finds" are
        the account value of the policy before an activity is an amount.
    the result is the answer to query net_deposit.
    the answers to "which activity fails the check which code" are listed as "Checks".
    the result shows its citations.

